      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IM HAVINTOTROT (7) resumes from a spell of four months after closing off last campaign in good form, scoring at his last appearance over 1650m at Bendigo. Must overcome a very wide draw but is sure to prove hard to beat on his return. ZARSKI (4) was a head away in second at Kilmore over 2180m last start at his first run back from a spell. That latest effort is good enough to take out a race like this. SCAR (5) has been thereabouts of late and is a great chance to break through. Good effort last time out when he finished third at Melton over 2240m. Top-three commodity. EL TORNADO (1) is worth some thought after his last-start fourth over 2200m at this track on July 23. May earn some minor money.",
